You need to get yourself MR and fast!  Your are getting to the point
where you will see a lot more Liches who can destroy your armor.  I
personally prefer a cloak of magic resistance and SDSM so I can wear an
AoLS as insurance against my own stupidity.  If you get a GDSM you will
need a AoR and then something else for your cloak.

Normally I don't wear a robe.  I stash it in my bag until I'm trying to
ID a bunch of stuff or to cast Magic Mapping.

Given the choice between CoP and CoD I would choose displacement.  CoP
is only worth 3 more AC while displacement causes monsters to miss you
and cast spells at the wrong spot.  And if a monster guesses where you
are at you can move and reset your location.  They will start missing
again until they can reguess your location.

But keep in mind that CoP is MC3 and CoD is MC2, but you should be ok
with MC2.

As for gloves I would enchant the GoP and wear those for the big
strength bonus.



